---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Home">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold">Danny Brown</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
    Software engineer. I write about the tools and systems I build.
  </p>
  <p class="mt-4">
    See <a class="underline" href="/projects">projects</a> or read the
    <a class="underline" href="/blog">blog</a>.
  </p>

  <section class="mt-10">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Featured: ccgarden</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      A generative-art tree grown from Claude Code session history — trunk
      width and rings track sessions, branches are repos, leaves are
      individual sessions, clouds are models, bushes are tools, flowers are
      cache efficiency. Zero dependencies, pure-stdlib Python rendering a
      self-contained animated SVG. Below is my own real session history.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      Watch it grow, then hover any leaf, branch, cloud, or bush for its
      numbers — or drag the time-travel slider to replay any day. This
      regenerates from my actual session logs, so it changes as I work.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
      The dollar figures are what the same usage <em>would</em> cost at
      pay-as-you-go API rates — not what I pay. It's a Claude Pro
      subscription at $20/month; treat the number as a measure of value
      received rather than a bill.
    </p>
    <!-- <object>, not <img>: the SVG needs its own document so its tooltips,
         SMIL growth animation, and time-travel scrubber script all work. -->
    <div
      class="relative left-1/2 mt-4 aspect-[800/848] w-screen max-w-3xl -translate-x-1/2 px-4"
    >
      <object
        type="image/svg+xml"
        data="/ccgarden.svg"
        class="h-full w-full"
        aria-label="A ccgarden tree visualization grown from my real Claude Code session history, regenerated on each commit"
      >
      </object>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm">
      <a class="underline" href="https://github.com/dannybrown37/ccgarden">
        View on GitHub
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
